// `koruc <file> help` prints "No commands defined in <file>" even when the
// program's imports declare commands that DO dispatch — `install`/`i` from
// std/package runs on this very file. The enumerator scans the pre-merge
// entry AST while the dispatcher resolves post-merge, so help reports a
// command surface that is not the real one. The tool claims something false
// about its own verbs.

~import std/package

~tor main {}

~proc main|zig {
}

~main()
